{"nodes": [{"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_mbs_model_schema", "label": "MBS model YAML schema", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lists all physics items of a mechanical system: bodies (required), joints, passive force elements, motors and actuators, constraints and external loads. Enum values are accepted in any case (point_line, POINT_LINE, PoInT_LiNe) to keep hand-written YAML forgiving."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_bodies", "label": "YAML body specification", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mass and inertia moments are required only if the body is not fixed; orientation accepts either Euler-Cardan angles [yaw, pitch, roll] or a quaternion [e0..e3]; inertia is expressed in the centroidal frame while geometry is expressed in the body reference frame."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_contact_material", "label": "Contact materials and collision shapes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Materials and shapes are separate lists joined by material name, so more shapes than materials can share one material. The same friction/restitution values behave differently under SMC and NSC; under SMC the user may give either material physical properties (Young modulus, Poisson ratio) or spring-damper coefficients (normal/tangential stiffness and damping)."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_body_visualization", "label": "Body visualization shapes vs model_file", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A model_file is passed as-is to the run-time visualization system, whereas a MESH shape is assumed to be an OBJ Wavefront file and therefore also supports translation, rotation and scaling."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_joints", "label": "Joints (kinematic or bushing)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One joint entry becomes an ideal kinematic constraint, or a stiff-compliance bushing if bushing_data is present, so stiffness can be introduced without restructuring the model. Bushings are prohibited for PRISMATIC, CYLINDRICAL, POINT_LINE and POINT_PLANE joints."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_bushing_data", "label": "bushing_data compliance", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Top-level stiffness/damping relax the constrained DOFs of the ideal joint; the nested DOF object optionally adds compliance along the unconstrained DOF, which defaults to 0.0 when the DOF object is absent."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_constraints", "label": "Additional constraints (DISTANCE, REVOLUTE-SPHERICAL, REVOLUTE-TRANSLATIONAL)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_tsda", "label": "TSDA translational spring-damper", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One element type covers three regimes selected purely by which keys are present: linear (spring_coefficient/damping_coefficient), degressive damper (damping_coefficient plus degressivity_compression and degressivity_expansion, and no spring_coefficient), and nonlinear tabular data (spring_curve_data, damping_curve_data, or deformation/map_data) linearly interpolated at run time."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_rsda", "label": "RSDA rotational spring-damper", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Applies torques about an axis with a free_angle and preload; linear and nonlinear torques are specified exactly like the corresponding TSDA forces."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_motors", "label": "Motors (LINEAR / ROTATION)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Actuation is expressed at the POSITION, SPEED or FORCE level through a time function, and the accompanying kinematic guide (FREE/PRISMATIC/SPHERICAL) or spindle (FREE/REVOLUTE/CYLINDRICAL) constraint is chosen separately, so actuation and constraint concerns stay independent."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_functions", "label": "Generic time-function object", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only type is required and it selects which further fields are valid: CONSTANT, POLYNOMIAL, SINE, RAMP, DATA (linearly interpolated points), and CONTROLLER which defers the value to an external controller. Every type except CONTROLLER accepts an optional repeat block (start/width/shift) to replicate the function periodically."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_body_loads", "label": "Body loads and load controllers", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "FORCE or TORQUE applied to a named body, with explicit local_load and local_point flags so the frame of the load vector and its application point are never implicit."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_fea", "label": "FEA components in the MBS model", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Requires the Chrono::FEA module; in a build without it the whole FEA object is ignored with a warning rather than failing. Support is explicitly partial: of the beam section types only ANCF_CABLE is implemented, no FEA material type is implemented, shells are not implemented, and only NODE_FRAME, NODESLOPE_FRAME and NODE_NODE constraints exist - an unimplemented type raises a run-time error. Note the misspelled Rayleight_damping key."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_fea_constraints", "label": "FEA constraints and node references", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A node is addressed by mesh name plus a 1-based index within that mesh, where a beam's name doubles as its mesh name. NODE_FRAME ties a node to a body, NODESLOPE_FRAME additionally constrains the node slope direction, NODE_NODE ties two FEA nodes."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_fea_mesh_visualization", "label": "FEA mesh colormap and glyph visualization", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_mbs_model_schema", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_bodies", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_mbs_model_schema", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_joints", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_mbs_model_schema", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_mbs_model_constraints", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_mbs_model.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_pa